# This repo needs Node >=22: vitest 4 / rolldown import `node:util.styleText` (Node 20.12+),
# and the native rolldown binding is only linked when install runs under Node 22.
# Pin the runtime here so `pnpm test` / `pnpm lint` / `pnpm install` use Node 22 even when the
# shell's default `node` is older. pnpm downloads this version on first use.
use-node-version=22.22.3
